_spread":null,"_gate_roic_consistency":null,"_gp_roic_consistency":null,"_score_roic_consistency":null,"_gate_incr_roic":null,"_gp_incr_roic":null,"_score_incr_roic":null,"_gate_margin_advantage":null,"_gp_margin_advantage":null,"_score_margin_advantage":null,"_gate_pool_share":null,"_gp_pool_share":null,"_score_pool_share":null,"_gate_rev_durability":0.013918370600665808,"_gp_rev_durability":false,"_score_rev_durability":32.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.014860097028573679,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":27.6,"_gate_share_shrink":-0.009373508515901019,"_gp_share_shrink":true,"_score_share_shrink":61.7,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.02354985878774712,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":60.8,"_gate_insider_own":0.08140001,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":54.3,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Eagle Bancorp, Inc. operates as the bank holding company for EagleBank that provides commercial and consumer banking services primarily in the United States. The provide deposit services including business and personal checking accounts; and other deposit services, including cash management services, business sweep accounts, lock boxes, remote deposit captures, account reconciliation services, merchant card services, safety deposit boxes, and automated clearing house origination, as well as after-hours depositories and ATM services. It also offers various commercial and consumer lending products comprising commercial loans for working capital, equipment purchases, real estate lines of credit, and government contract financing; asset based lending and accounts receivable financing; construction and commercial real estate loans; business equipment financing; consumer home equity lines of credit, personal lines of credit, and term loans; consumer installment loans, such as auto and personal loans; and personal credit cards. In addition, the company provides online and mobile banking services; insurance products and services through a referral program; and treasury management services. The company serves sole proprietors, small, medium, and middle-sized businesses, partnerships, corporations, and non-profit organizations and associations, as well as investors. Eagle Bancorp, Inc. was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Bethesda, Maryland.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Stephen R. Curley | President, CEO & Director | Age 54","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 475 people. Revenue per employee of $630K ranks in the above the sector median among Financial Services peers, improving at 7%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $44K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $15K per employee reflects an ownership culture. Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Eagle Bancorp, Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $1.0B market cap on $299M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -6% over the past three years and +1% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome. Operating margins are contracting by -7.1pp, the first warning that competitive pressure is eroding the franchise.","Returns on capital run at 6% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $21M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 7 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, thin -0.6\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 1.5%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 8.1% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Operating margins contracting -7.1pp YoY \u2014 competitive pressure is eroding the franchise","sev":"red","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Price sits 219% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":2.194969876914832},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Revenue growth in the bottom decile of Financial Services peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"red","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins 95% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (12.5% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Is Eagle Bancorp (EGBN) Fairly Valued After Its Return To Profit?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/banks/nasdaq-egbn/eagle-bancorp/news/is-eagle-bancorp-egbn-fairly-valued-after-its-return-to-prof","date":"2026-11-02","timestamp":1793583306.557,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.856,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"tit